y Lets You Do It</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9pOsHdRi1_text","label":"gg9pOsHdRi1_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Aging dogs with sensitive gums have almost always been traumatized by toothbrushes. FreshWipes sit on your finger. Your dog already trusts your touch. No hard bristles, no foreign object, no panic. Most aging dogs accept it on the very first try.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbaZv12Qv-_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggbaZv12Qv-_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/16.gif"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbaZv12Qv-_srcSet_mobile_src","label":"ggbaZv12Qv-_srcSet_mobile_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/16.gif"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwiTboWn2Q_text","label":"ggwiTboWn2Q_text","default":"<strong>🌿 Fresh Breath</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzedAF2H2U_text","label":"ggzedAF2H2U_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">Day 3-5</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggx2UWSN98u_text","label":"ggx2UWSN98u_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>2. The Breath Starts Changing</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWI-g2MZdE_text","label":"ggWI-g2MZdE_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">That smell that has just become background noise starts fading. The antibacterial ingredients in FreshWipes go after the bacteria causing the odor directly, not just covering it up. Most owners notice it before the first week is even over.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://shopvetpets.com/products/freshwipes-30sec-routine?abtr=true\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>👉 </strong></a><a href=\"https://shopvetpets.com/products/freshwipes-30sec-routine?abtr=true\"><strong><u>Start Freshening Your Dog's Breath Today</u></strong></a></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggse8L-v7ED_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggse8L-v7ED_srcS